        "title": "Expert Backed Review Summary",
        "text": "<p>Nutritionally, each serving provides <strong>7g of protein, 3g of carbohydrates, and 50 calories</strong>, along with approximately 0.9g of naturally occurring BCAAs. Because much of the peanut fat is removed during processing, the powder can be an easy way to add peanut flavor and protein while keeping overall calories and fat lower than conventional peanut butter. Versatility is another advantage. NAKED PB can be blended into protein shakes and smoothies, stirred into oatmeal or yogurt, incorporated into baked goods, or used in sweet and savory sauces. Adding water also allows you to adjust the consistency and turn the powder into a peanut butter-style spread. The product is made from peanuts sourced exclusively from U.S. farms and is processed and packaged in the United States. According to the product information, it is vegan, non-GMO, dairy-free, soy-free, and independently third-party tested for heavy metals.</p>",
